[2026-11-24T22:12:40Z] note: assumptions: (1) BTC/USD → Binance BTCUSDT, the project's only crypto venue. (2) 100%-equity sizing instead of risk_fraction (user's choice for library specs, keeps the leaderboard comparable). (3) EMA/RMA seeded with the SMA of the first n values (INDICATORS.md); 300-bar warm-up for every set so all runs start on the same day. (4) Search ranges = the spec's Min/Max; step sizes chosen for a daily grid. (5) TRIX(n) = 100 × one-bar ROC of EMA(EMA(EMA(C, n), n), n). SMA(100) is a fixed constant. Budget per library coordinator: base 0.5 h, screen (workers 2), broad basket 1 h; one chain at a time under a shared slot lock.
