[2026-11-24T22:12:40Z] note: sanity check: defaults IS 10 trades, +29.6% (+4.8%/yr), win 60%, PF 1.93, DD -22.6%, exits 6 target / 2 stop / 2 signal; B&H +548%. OOS 10 trades, +3.3%/yr, DD -20.2%. Zero-line crosses are rare on daily bars (~2 per year).
